     {
      "id": "p_8e40bf_3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "With over 7 years of experience in medical sales and marketing, our journey led us to establish KAPSONS — a company born from passion and precision.",
      "style": {
       "textColor": "#0b1a3d"
      }
     },
     {
      "id": "p_8e40bf_4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "From this journey came SURZION, a brand designed to represent The Surgical Excellence.",
      "style": {
       "textColor": "#0b1a3d"
      }
     },
     {
      "id": "p_8e40bf_5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Our instruments, made with 410, 420, and 316-grade stainless steel, as well as tungsten carbide and titanium materials, meet international standards of quality.",
      "style": {
       "textColor": "#0b1a3d"
      }
     },
